{"number":1,"sceneNumber":1,"heading":{"raw":"INT. USS ENTERPRISE - ENGINE ROOM - DAY","intExt":"INT","location":"USS ENTERPRISE - ENGINE ROOM","timeOfDay":"DAY"},"context":{"set":"INT. USS ENTERPRISE - ENGINE ROOM - DAY","lighting":"warm practical sources, bright, even illumination, from windows, very warm (2000K)","timeOfDay":"DAY","atmosphere":"romantic","weather":null},"characters":[{"name":"CAPTAIN","position":"not visible","appearance":"","wardrobe":"The CAPTAIN is dressed in a sleek Starfleet uniform, tailored to perfection. The uniform is a deep navy blue, accented with silver piping along the seams, and adorned with the Starfleet insignia on the chest. The fabric is a high-tech blend, designed for both comfort and durability, with a subtle sheen that catches the light. Polished black boots complete the ensemble, adding to the CAPTAIN's authoritative appearance.","physicalAppearance":"The CAPTAIN is a commanding presence, exuding authority and confidence. With a chiseled jawline and piercing eyes, they appear to be in their late 40s, with a physique that suggests both strength and agility. Their hair is neatly trimmed, with a few strands of silver hinting at their experience and wisdom. The CAPTAIN's demeanor is calm and collected, yet there's an underlying intensity that suggests they are always ready for action.","emotion":"focused and determined","action":null},{"name":"WIZARD CLIF HIGH","position":"enters scene","appearance":"mid-70s, magnificent long white beard, slightly stooped but spry, carrying an ornate staff","wardrobe":"Clad in Starfleet robes that blend the futuristic with the mystical, WIZARD CLIF HIGH's attire is a deep midnight blue, adorned with intricate silver embroidery that resembles constellations. A pointed wizard hat sits atop his head, adding to his enigmatic aura. He carries an ornate staff, carved with runes and topped with a glowing crystal, which he wields with dramatic flair.","physicalAppearance":"WIZARD CLIF HIGH is a striking figure, with a magnificent long white beard that flows down to his chest, giving him an air of ancient wisdom. Despite being in his mid-70s, he is slightly stooped but moves with a spry energy that belies his age. His eyes twinkle with a mischievous glint, and his face is lined with the marks of a life well-lived, each wrinkle telling a story of its own.","emotion":"mystical and commanding","action":null}],"set":"INT. USS ENTERPRISE - ENGINE ROOM - DAY","description":"The engine room is a fascinating blend of science fiction and fantasy, reminiscent of a classic Star Trek set but with enchanting twists. The walls are lined with sleek, metallic panels interspersed with glowing control interfaces, casting a soft, ambient light. Floating candles hover in mid-air, their flames flickering gently, adding a warm, mystical glow to the room. In one corner, a cauldron bubbles with a mysterious concoction, sending wisps of steam into the air. Constellation charts and star maps are scattered across the walls, creating a tapestry of celestial navigation. The atmosphere is one of wonder and intrigue, where technology meets magic in a seamless dance.","actions":"waving his staff dramatically","dialogue":"CAPTAIN\nover intercom\nClif, we need warp 9 to Rigel VII. Make it so.","blocking":"WIZARD CLIF HIGH: stands stands at the center of the engine room (center stage) [none]","sfx":"No sound effects specified","techDetails":"Shot Type: establishing. Camera Movement: static. Framing: medium. Visual Style: Reality","metadata":{"shotType":"establishing","cameraMovement":"static","framing":"medium","visualStyle":"Reality","cinematicStyle":null,"technicalNotes":[]},"duration":{"seconds":7.4,"formatted":"0:07"},"characterCount":{"count":1016,"limit":1016,"percentage":100},"warnings":[]}
