ws dance across the room, adding a sense of mystery and depth to the scene.","actions":"pauses. sighs deeply","dialogue":"No dialogue in this shot","blocking":"WIZARD CLIF HIGH: stands at the center of the engine room (center stage)","sfx":"No sound effects specified","techDetails":"Shot Type: establishing. Camera Movement: static. Framing: wide. Visual Style: Reality","metadata":{"shotType":"establishing","cameraMovement":"static","framing":"wide","visualStyle":"Reality","cinematicStyle":null,"technicalNotes":[]},"duration":{"seconds":3,"formatted":"0:03"},"characterCount":{"count":874,"limit":874,"percentage":100},"warnings":[]}
