ntion on the warp core, which seems to breathe with a life of its own. The air is filled with the faint scent of ozone, a reminder of the immense power harnessed within this technological heart.","actions":"enters. carrying a PADD","dialogue":"No dialogue in this shot","blocking":"HEIDI: enters enters the engine room, carrying a PADD (stage right, downstage) [near the warp core]\nWIZARD CLIF HIGH: stands stands at the center of the engine room (center stage)","sfx":"SOUND EFFECT: The ship LURCHES forward.. SOUND EFFECT: Magical sparkles swirl around the warp core.","techDetails":"Shot Type: wide. Camera Movement: static. Framing: wide. Visual Style: Reality","metadata":{"shotType":"wide","cameraMovement":"static","framing":"wide","visualStyle":"Reality","cinematicStyle":null,"technicalNotes":[]},"duration":{"seconds":6,"formatted":"0:06"},"characterCount":{"count":1178,"limit":1178,"percentage":100},"warnings":[]}
