{"number":"39a","sceneNumber":2,"heading":{"raw":"INT. USS ENTERPRISE - CONFERENCE ROOM - CONTINUOUS","intExt":"INT","location":"USS ENTERPRISE - CONFERENCE ROOM","timeOfDay":"CONTINUOUS"},"context":{"set":"INT. USS ENTERPRISE - CONFERENCE ROOM - CONTINUOUS","lighting":"natural ambient, balanced, neutral (5000K)","timeOfDay":"CONTINUOUS","atmosphere":"neutral","weather":null},"characters":[{"name":"HEIDI","position":"in scene","appearance":"mid-20s, young and attractive, fresh-faced","wardrobe":"Heidi wears a Starfleet engineering uniform, a sleek and functional attire in a deep navy blue with silver accents. The uniform fits her form perfectly, allowing ease of movement while maintaining a professional appearance. A wand holster is strapped to her belt, hinting at her unique blend of engineering prowess and magical abilities. She carries a PADD, a standard device for data access and communication, underscoring her role and responsibilities.","physicalAppearance":"Heidi is in her mid-20s, exuding a youthful and attractive aura. Her fresh-faced complexion is complemented by bright, inquisitive eyes that seem to absorb every detail of her surroundings. Her hair, neatly tied back, reveals a smooth forehead and a confident demeanor. Her athletic build suggests agility and strength, essential traits for her role in Starfleet engineering.","emotion":"concerned","action":null},{"name":"WIZARD CLIF HIGH","position":"in scene","appearance":"mid-70s, magnificent long white beard, slightly stooped but spry, carrying an ornate staff","wardrobe":"Clad in Starfleet robes that blend the futuristic with the mystical, WIZARD CLIF HIGH's attire is a deep midnight blue, adorned with intricate silver embroidery that resembles constellations. A pointed wizard hat sits atop his head, adding to his enigmatic aura. He carries an ornate staff, carved with runes and topped with a glowing crystal, which he wields with dramatic flair.","physicalAppearance":"WIZARD CLIF HIGH is a striking figure, with a magnificent long white beard that flows down to his chest, giving him an air of ancient wisdom. Despite being in his mid-70s, he is slightly stooped but moves with a spry energy that belies his age. His eyes twinkle with a mischievous glint, and his face is lined with the marks of a life well-lived, each wrinkle telling a story of its own.","emotion":"mystical and commanding","action":null}],"set":"INT. USS ENTERPRISE - CONFERENCE ROOM - CONTINUOUS","description":"The room is a blend of futuristic and mystical elements, with sleek metallic walls that shimmer under the ambient lighting, casting a soft glow across the space. A large, oval table dominates the center, crafted from a dark, polished wood that contrasts with the high-tech surroundings. The atmosphere is charged with an air of anticipation, heightened by the subtle hum of hidden machinery. Overhead, a series of intricate light fixtures hang, their design reminiscent of ancient chandeliers, yet they emit a cool, modern luminescence. The overall mood is one of mystery and intrigue, as if the room itself holds secrets waiting to be uncovered.","actions":"Clif throws FLU POWDER on the ground","dialogue":"HEIDI\ngrabbing Clif's hand\nWhere are we going?\n\nCLIF\nRisa. I hear the beaches are lovely this time of year.","blocking":"WIZARD CLIF HIGH: sits sits across from HEIDI (center stage) [across from HEIDI]\nHEIDI: sits sits across from WIZARD CLIF HIGH (center stage) [across from WIZARD CLIF HIGH]\nCAPTAIN: sits sits at the head of the table (center stage, upstage) [at the head of the table]\nFIRST OFFICER: stands stands (center stage, upstage)","sfx":"SOUND EFFECT: Green flames erupt","techDetails":"Shot Type: establishing. Camera Movement: static. Framing: wide. Visual Style: Reality","metadata":{"shotType":"establishing","cameraMovement":"static","framing":"wide","visualStyle":"Reality","cinematicStyle":null,"technicalNotes":[]},"duration":{"seconds":9,"formatted":"0:09"},"characterCount":{"count"