{"number":41,"sceneNumber":2,"heading":{"raw":"INT. USS ENTERPRISE - CONFERENCE ROOM - CONTINUOUS","intExt":"INT","location":"USS ENTERPRISE - CONFERENCE ROOM","timeOfDay":"CONTINUOUS"},"context":{"set":"INT. USS ENTERPRISE - CONFERENCE ROOM - CONTINUOUS","lighting":"natural ambient, balanced, neutral (5000K)","timeOfDay":"CONTINUOUS","atmosphere":"neutral","weather":null},"characters":[{"name":"FIRST OFFICER","position":"in scene","appearance":"","wardrobe":"The FIRST OFFICER is clad in a Starfleet uniform that mirrors the sleek design of the CAPTAIN's attire. The uniform is a deep navy blue, tailored to fit his slender frame perfectly. It features subtle silver accents along the shoulders and cuffs, adding a touch of elegance to the otherwise utilitarian design. A Starfleet insignia is prominently displayed on his chest, and his rank is denoted by a series of silver pips on his collar. His attire is completed with polished black boots that reflect the ambient light.","physicalAppearance":"The FIRST OFFICER is a striking figure, reminiscent of the iconic Vulcan archetype. His sharp, angular features are accentuated by his pointy ears and a perpetually raised eyebrow, giving him an air of intellectual superiority. His skin is a pale olive tone, and his eyes are a piercing shade of blue, reflecting a calm yet calculating demeanor. He stands tall and lean, exuding a sense of discipline and precision in every movement.","emotion":"calm and calculating","action":null}],"set":"INT. USS ENTERPRISE - CONFERENCE ROOM - CONTINUOUS","description":"The room is a grand, circular chamber with high, vaulted ceilings that echo with a sense of ancient wisdom. The walls are adorned with intricate tapestries depicting celestial maps and arcane symbols, their colors muted by the dim, ambient lighting that casts a warm, golden hue across the space. A large, round table made of polished mahogany dominates the center, its surface reflecting the flickering light of candles placed strategically around the room. The air is thick with the scent of aged parchment and incense, creating an atmosphere of mystery and reverence. Shadows dance along the stone floor, adding a dynamic, almost ethereal quality to the setting, as if the room itself is alive with secrets waiting to be uncovered.","actions":"They step into the flames. DISAPPEAR in a swirl of green smoke and sparkles","dialogue":"FIRST OFFICER\nCaptain... the warp field is collapsing.","blocking":"WIZARD CLIF HIGH: sits sits across from HEIDI (center stage) [across from HEIDI]\nHEIDI: sits sits across from WIZARD CLIF HIGH (center stage) [across from WIZARD CLIF HIGH]\nCAPTAIN: sits sits at the head of the table (center stage, upstage) [at the head of the table]\nFIRST OFFICER: stands stands (center stage, upstage)","sfx":"SOUND EFFECT: a soft whoosh as they disappear. SOUND EFFECT: crackling of flames","techDetails":"Shot Type: medium. Camera Movement: static. Framing: medium. Visual Style: Reality","metadata":{"shotType":"medium","cameraMovement":"static","framing":"medium","visualStyle":"Reality","cinematicStyle":null,"technicalNotes":[]},"duration":{"seconds":5.4,"formatted":"0:05"},"characterCount":{"count":1395,"limit":1395,"percentage":100},"warnings":[]}
{"number":"42a","sceneNumber":2,"heading":{"raw":"INT. USS ENTERPRISE - CONFERENCE ROOM - CONTINUOUS","intExt":"INT","location":"USS ENTERPRISE - CONFERENCE ROOM","timeOfDay":"CONTINUOUS"},"context":{"set":"INT. USS ENTERPRISE - CONFERENCE ROOM - CONTINUOUS","lighting":"natural ambient, balanced, neutral (5000K)","timeOfDay":"CONTINUOUS","atmosphere":"neutral","weather":null},"characters":[{"name":"CAPTAIN","position":"in scene","appearance":"50s, stern, classic Starfleet","wardrobe":"The CAPTAIN is dressed in a sleek Starfleet uniform, tailored to perfection. The uniform is a deep navy blue, accented with silver piping along the seams, and adorned with the Starfleet insignia on the chest. The fabric is a high-tech blend, designed for both comfort and durability, with a subtle sheen that catches the light. Polished black boots complete the ensemble, adding to the CAPTAIN's authoritative appearance.","physicalAppearance":"The CAPTAIN is a commanding presence, exuding authority and confidence. With a chiseled jawline and piercing eyes, they appear to be in their late 40s, with a physique that suggests both strength and agility. Their hair is neatly trimmed, with a few strands of silver hinting at their experience and wisdom. The CAPTAIN's demeanor is calm and collected, yet there's an underlying intensity that suggests they are always ready for action.","emotion":"focused and determined","action":null}],"set":"INT. USS ENTERPRISE - CONFERENCE ROOM - CONTINUOUS","description":"The starship's command center is a sleek, futuristic space, dominated by a large, oval-shaped table at its heart. The walls are lined with high-tech panels, displaying streams of data and star maps, casting a soft, ambient glow. The room is bathed in a dim, red hue, reflecting the urgency of the situation. Overhead, recessed lighting flickers slightly, adding to the tension. The floor is a polished metallic surface, reflecting the red alert lights. The atmosphere is tense, filled with the hum of machinery and the distant, rhythmic pulse of the ship's engines. The air feels charged, as if the room itself is bracing for impact.","actions":"No specific actions in this shot","dialogue":"CAPTAIN\ngrabbing the table\nDoes ANYONE on this ship know magic?! Anyone take a weekend course? Read a book?!","blocking":"WIZARD CLIF HIGH: sits sits across from HEIDI (center stage) [across from HEIDI]\nHEIDI: sits sits across from WIZARD CLIF HIGH (center stage) [across from WIZARD CLIF HIGH]\nCAPTAIN: sits sits at the head of the table (center stage, upstage) [at the head of the table]\nFIRST OFFICER: stands stands (center stage, upstage)","sfx":"SOUND EFFECT: The ship SHUDDERS violently.. SOUND EFFECT: Red alert klaxons blare.","techDetails":"Shot Type: establishing. Camera Movement: static. Framing: medium. Visual Style: Reality","metadata":{"shotType":"establishing","cameraMovement":"static","framing":"medium","visualStyle":"Reality","cinematicStyle":null,"technicalNotes":[]},"duration":{"seconds":9,"formatted":"0:09"},"characterCount":{"count":1313,"limit":1313,"percentage":100},"warnings":[]}
