ugh the floor. Overhead, a series of recessed lights cast a cool, bluish hue, creating an otherworldly ambiance. The atmosphere is charged, as if the very fabric of space-time is on the brink of unraveling.","actions":"No specific actions in this shot","dialogue":"No dialogue in this shot","blocking":"WIZARD CLIF HIGH: sits sits across from HEIDI (center stage) [across from HEIDI]\nHEIDI: sits sits across from WIZARD CLIF HIGH (center stage) [across from WIZARD CLIF HIGH]\nCAPTAIN: sits sits at the head of the table (center stage, upstage) [at the head of the table]\nFIRST OFFICER: stands stands (center stage, upstage)","sfx":"SOUND EFFECT: The ship LURCHES.. SOUND EFFECT: Sparks fly.","techDetails":"Shot Type: establishing. Camera Movement: static. Framing: wide. Visual Style: Reality","metadata":{"shotType":"establishing","cameraMovement":"static","framing":"wide","visualStyle":"Reality","cinematicStyle":null,"technicalNotes":[]},"duration":{"seconds":12,"formatted":"0:12"},"characterCount":{"count":1357,"limit":1357,"percentage":100},"warnings":[]}
